{"id":"memorial_103801","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial103800","label":"Data · Piling Project Report"},"label":"Piling Project No. 14","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"memorial_103802","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_103801_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_38_01_description","text":"In order to designate coordinates, we created a supporting disc that is placed on the ground."},{"id":"memorial_103801_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_38_01_description","text":"After conducting numerous tests,"},{"id":"memorial_103801_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_38_01_description","text":"we adopted a flat design that is easy to carry and can adapt to various types of terrain."},{"id":"memorial_103801_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_38_01_description","text":"However, further research is necessary to embed a GPS feature."}]}